    "displayName": "PL_FMD_LOAD_GOLD_TEMPLATE",
    "description": "Template Gold-layer load pipeline for a business domain: NB_LOAD_GOLD, then NB_MLV_EXAMPLE. Swap NB_MLV_EXAMPLE for your domain's own MLV notebook(s), and add a PBISemanticModelRefresh activity pointing at your domain's semantic model after deployment. Not part of the core FMD chain: one per business domain, invoked from your orchestration pipeline (see PL_FMD_ORCHESTRATION_TEMPLATE)."
